Subject: [PATCH 54/54] VS Seeker rematches catch up; Lucky Egg from Koga

- Until all eight badges, a VS Seeker rematch Pokemon below 5 levels
  under the next Gym Leader's ace is raised to that level and evolves if
  the new level allows (level-based evolutions).
- Koga gives a Lucky Egg after his gym (existing saves: talk to him again).

